<title>BRAZIL: Spain's Aznar to visit Brazil and Argentina.</title>
<headline>Spain's Aznar to visit Brazil and Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Prime Minister Jose Maria Aznar will visit Brazil and Argentina next month, diplomats said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A diplomat at the Spanish embassy in Brasilia said the Spanish leader would visit the capital and Sao Paulo, Brazil's economic powerhouse, on April 18-19 before going to Argentina.</p>
</text>
